Notice for ai-ad-formats

No upstream license is stated. The source is a public Notion list, Claude Creative
Skill Library Vol 2 (https://app.notion.com/p/Claude-Creative-Skill-Library-Vol-2-3ffb5f1fde2d81938bb9eb76ea6c60d1) by PYNK Society. The page describes each skill and links to
a download. The download pack and the page were read, and no upstream text or code
is copied here. This folder describes the same workflow in new words for Subclip and
credits the list and its author. The example images marked as coming from the
creator's list are the author's pictures from the skill's page, shown with credit
at the request of the Subclip owner.

